      "message": "When testing non-alignment validation, we need to test at least a success case that\u0027s exactly the required alignment (so 4 in this case, 0 is not enough because it is aligned to everything), and error case that\u0027s for the next smaller power of two, so 2 in this case. (no need to use sizeof since the spec will directly spell out 4, the literal 2 is fine)",
